<title>POLAND: LUBAWA Q1 NET RISES TO PLN 1.0 MLN.</title>
<headline>LUBAWA Q1 NET RISES TO PLN 1.0 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lubawa preliminary results for</p>
<p>the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 0.20 vs	0.59</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   1.60 vs	0.50</p>
<p>    net profit				 1.00 vs	0.29</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Zaklady Konfekcji Technicznej</p>
<p>Lubawa SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				  6.22 vs	7.36</p>
<p>    costs of sales			   5.01 vs	6.09</p>
